In-Reply-To: <VwsYhG9cVWk.emzkFo7wLUUJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
References: <VwsYhG9cVWk.emzkFo7wLUUJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rattle-users/c/VwsYhG9cVWk/m/FMfHK06AUa8J>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

On Rattle's Evaluate Tab, choose the Score option, and CSV File
(assuming the data comes from a CSV file) or R Dataset (if the data is
in R as a data frame).

Regards,
Graham

